{"id":242170,"bangumiId":242170,"type":2,"name":"オーバーロードⅢ","name_cn":"OVERLORD 第三季","date":"2018-07-10","year":"2018","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg"},"summary":"时间为2138年。曾卷起一大风潮的虚拟现实体感型网络游戏《YGGDRASIL》即将迎来停服。玩家飞鼠在曾经以同伴和荣华自傲的根据地纳萨力克地下大坟墓，独自一人安静等待着那一刻。但是，不料发生了“过了结束时间却还没有登出”的异常事态。NPC们开始以自己的意志行动，不止如此，纳萨力克之外展开了从未见过的异世界。飞鼠为了寻找过去的同伴，以公会名安兹·乌尔·恭自称，决定在异世界扬名立万。他与宣誓绝对忠诚的部下一同，向新的地域进军。","rating":{"rank":5965,"total":9892,"count":{"1":81,"2":53,"3":114,"4":346,"5":1095,"6":3468,"7":3300,"8":1075,"9":165,"10":195},"score":6.4},"collection":{"on_hold":218,"dropped":284,"wish":682,"collect":19101,"doing":472},"tags":[{"name":"MADHouse","count":1443,"total_count":112683},{"name":"轻小说改","count":1361,"total_count":511129},{"name":"2018年7月","count":1262,"total_count":26552},{"name":"骨傲天","count":1193,"total_count":5893},{"name":"异世界","count":1153,"total_count":275223},{"name":"穿越","count":1143,"total_count":66152},{"name":"TV","count":958,"total_count":1450316},{"name":"奇幻","count":954,"total_count":494405},{"name":"OVERLORD","count":647,"total_count":3679},{"name":"装逼","count":546,"total_count":9419},{"name":"轻改","count":543,"total_count":156283},{"name":"龙傲天","count":538,"total_count":40932},{"name":"2018","count":476,"total_count":79519},{"name":"网游","count":253,"total_count":14547},{"name":"战斗","count":250,"total_count":491920},{"name":"小说改","count":190,"total_count":168675},{"name":"日本","count":120,"total_count":316406},{"name":"第三季","count":96,"total_count":1588},{"name":"续作","count":59,"total_count":48392},{"name":"伊藤尚往","count":57,"total_count":547},{"name":"搞笑","count":41,"total_count":659584},{"name":"后宫","count":30,"total_co